      "index": "al",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 673080330,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 651489546,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787094949475,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) \"search near my current location\" and \"search near an arbitrary address/place.\"\n2) free-text + category/filter search combined with the geo constraint (e.g., `\"coffee\" within\n2km`).\n3) Support pagination over results.\n4) Keep entity data (name, hours, category, popularity) reasonably fresh as the real world\nchanges (new places open, places close, attributes update).\n5) (Stretch, shown on the diagram as a separate branch) typeahead/autocomplete while the\nuser types a query.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) \"search near my current location\" and \"search near an arbitrary address/place.\"\n2) free-text + category/filter search combined with the geo constraint (e.g., `\"coffee\" within 2km`).\n3) Support pagination over results.\n4) Keep entity data (name, hours, category, popularity) reasonably fresh as the real world changes (new places open, places close, attributes update).\n5) (Stretch, shown on the diagram as a separate branch) typeahead/autocomplete while the user types a query.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
