      "seed": 1743946250,
      "version": 314,
      "versionNonce": 929220182,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787100070353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Read failure -> degrade to partial results\n- DROP WRITE will provide stale position and affect correctness of the position\n- At-least-once delivery guarantee: idempotent last-write-wins by timestamp, monitor per entity \"update\nlag\" as first class metrics",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Read failure -> degrade to partial results\n- DROP WRITE will provide stale position and affect correctness of the position\n- At-least-once delivery guarantee: idempotent last-write-wins by timestamp, monitor per entity \"update lag\" as first class metrics",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
